      "source": [
        "# Fine-tune Gemma2 Model with QLoRA for SQL Generation\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook fine-tunes a Gemma2 model using QLoRA (Quantized Low-Rank Adaptation) to generate SQL queries from natural language questions."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
